WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.960
To make tomorrow's review reproducible, start with a clean queue and apply the priority shortcut.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:13.090
Save the current filters under a name that describes the review, then clear them to test the saved view rather than the current screen.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:19.540
Recall the name and check the priority indicator; if you need unassigned work as well, apply that condition explicitly.
